Fixtures for the internal/gitdiff tests.

The tests build a repository under t.TempDir(), commit these bytes into it and
read them back through git, so a fixture here is compared byte for byte with
what FileAt returns. Nothing in this directory is parsed: the lockfile parsers
have their own fixtures under internal/lockfile.

